     "text": "Every effort should be made to clarify the type of amyloid deposits in any patient with cardiac amyloidosis in a patient with MGUS at a specialist centre as MGUS and unrelated ATTR frequently coexist. Please note that both AL and ATTR may also occur concurrently.",
